<!-- AX7A200B DDR3 MIG 설정. 생성: hardware/constraints/ax7a200b_ddr3.xdc 핀표 + 매뉴얼 Part 2.4 -->
<!-- MT41J256M16HA-125 x2 (32 bit, 1 GiB), 400 MHz(800 MT/s), 입력 200 MHz 차동, UI 4:1 = 100 MHz -->
